@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### UC08 com JWT valido e agendamentos -> esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{validBearerToken}}

### UC08 sem autenticacao -> esperado: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings

### UC08 com JWT sem clientId -> esperado: 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{missingClientIdBearerToken}}

### UC08 sem agendamentos -> esperado: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{emptyListBearerToken}}

### Rota inexistente -> esperado: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings/rota-inexistente
Authorization: Bearer {{validBearerToken}}
